{"id":74,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"進学力と人間力を磨く総合的な学び","feature_description":"八王子学園八王子中学校・高等学校は、学力向上と人間的成長を両立する教育を行う学校です。授業、探究、行事、部活動を通して、基礎から応用へ学力を伸ばし、主体性や協働性を育てます。生徒一人ひとりの目標に応じた進路支援を大切にし、将来に向けて挑戦する力を養います。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":798,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":799,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":800,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":801,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":802,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":803,"name":"男子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":804,"name":"女子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":805,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":806,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":807,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":808,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":809,"name":"山岳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hachioji.ed.jp/senr/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":810,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www